Z||000013||1FST2M6||01-31-2001||09:41 AM||||not sure they are chris west long tube headers... <BR> <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com/Exhaust/Exhaust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cwestco.com/Exhaust/Exhaust.html</A> <P><BR>----------------------------<BR>These super headers give your Fiero engine the breathing room to perform as it was designed to perform. <P>Horsepower increases of 5% to 10% can be experienced to quickly take you from zero to three digits speeds.<BR>On a Dyno, this represents an increase<BR>of between 7 to 15 horsepower or more, depending on engine size.<P>These headers will give your engine significant torque and power increases in the 1500 to 5500 rpm range. <BR>--------------<P>thats copied from his page... <P>as you can see on my dyno sheet i was sucking wind till 4000rpm then only gained 7hp and 7lbft at 5252rpm  unless your running nitrous or a S/C i don't see them being worth the $. <BR><p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 01-31-2001).]||||reg||1
